            "notes": "round 3 and i NEVER budge on this.\n\ni take  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) as it amplifies mercy's self heal noticeably and it has great synergy when paired with  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48).  i've found that so long as you understand the fundamentals of positioning on mercy you will rarely need any other support items until at least round 5.\n\nif you can afford to you can keep  [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391)",
