            "created_at": "2025-08-02T02:41:29.685268+00:00",
            "notes": "ok so round 5 is gonna be a very game dependent turning point and i have several diff paths i run:\n\n1.  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) to make res a more active role in the game.  pair it with  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) for distance and CD reduction.  this is my most common choice.\n\n2.  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) if my team is slacking or i'm confident i'll find value out of it.  pair it with  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) for more WP and extended beam range in ult.  i prefer not run crep circle bc it limits mobility and feels clunky, but it can be very game changing and shouldn't be completely overlooked.\n\n3.  [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) if my dps are performing well and i can play more dmg boost heavy.\n\n4.  [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) if i find myself pushing heal more than boost.  as stadium is a very high heal dependent gamemode the dmg reduction can really help.",
