            "notes": "round 6 plays off of the previous round's path.\n\nRen path:  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) for survivability and CD reduction (makes res 24sec CD).\n\nCrep and ProBeam paths:  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) or  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you have the funds.\n\nDistortion path: if you're pushing more dmg boost might as well amplify it.  grab  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca).  if you're still lacking in heals  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) is a good option as well.",
